{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Wait for the stubborn child\u2019s terminal evidence**\n\nThe child intentionally runs for `invocationTimeout + 20s`, while the wrapper must return by deadline + 5s. Reading the trace immediately means `LATE_REJECTED`/`LATE_ACCEPTED` may not exist yet, so fixed behavior can still fail. Poll for `RESIDUAL_EXIT` and a late-operation outcome before asserting.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc70u_VF","finding_digest":"d8e51f5309ad8dee59b9868746f7f239cf943adc979fe13038e9a99eedf26058","finding_id":"arf_v1_3dsr6uyjvwg64wnzq2dun57shh","finding_key":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py::timeout_case::stubborn-residual-evidence-readiness","identity_key":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py::timeout_case::stubborn-residual-evidence-readiness","line":394,"observation_digest":"871bf138a51a70c32ac537e9b54a69a49b3c4c9ef86bdba49d69b862b0564aeb","observation_id":"aro_v1_q4n7coffdjymgkwfg7u3kstjus","path":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-25T15:19:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4kgonkresrhe3zeokjr6tzopro","reviewed_base_sha":"518cba16e0e690e1939feff222915ce841aa960b","reviewed_head_sha":"ff7d4732619701b61dc1be94834736365172cd9e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":394,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":728},"record_id":"art_v1_ghxfrqtv5cnxi7tnunzczptdfo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-25T15:19:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
